  "notes": [
    "Only models with a public, verified API price are listed.",
    "Models absent from this file are shown as unpriced. A model explicitly recorded as Auto is the only exception: it uses the lowest-priced current model configured for that subscription provider and is marked as an estimate.",
    "Tool-call charges, long-context surcharges, regional charges, and cache-write charges are not recoverable from the current local Codex ledger and are excluded.",
    "Subscription plans are stored separately in each user's application data directory and are never bundled in a public release.",
    "Models tagged \"source\": \"openrouter\" are refreshed automatically about once a week from OpenRouter's public pricing API (scripts/fetch_pricing.py, run by .github/workflows/update-pricing.yml); a genuine price change is recorded as a new dated period so past report dates keep using the rate that was actually in effect then. Models without that tag are maintained by hand."
